and so was discredited. Now new work D Recent studies show that his explanation of trait suggests that mice may pass on memories of a dangerous inheritance was entirely correct. smell. It is, however, based on epigenetics: changes that tweak the action of genes, not the genes themselves. So it fits with natural selection – and may yet give Lamarck’s name a sheen of respectability. Changing Moral Climates Social traditionalists have good cause to grieve. It must feel Encouragement of Piety and Virtue, and for the Preventing as if they are fighting a losing battle against secularisation and Punishing of Vice, Profaneness and Immorality – an and sexual liberation, trends that are in fashion even on exhortation against pornography that later became the 1857 the political right. As the West has grown richer in the Obscene Publications Act. This coincided with an effort to past 50 years, so the old bonds of organised religion and enforce a bourgeois sexual order upon an urban working patriarchy have loosened. There is a contemporary ‘End of class, swollen in number by the Industrial Revolution. History’ consensus that things like gay rights or abortion But we should not dismiss a complex and genuine desire are not just worthy causes or inalienable rights but are the to improve. The new middle class saw a link between eco- end goal of a grand historical process. nomics and morality that the Georgian aristocracy had not. Take the dramatic evolution in English moral stand-', 'a6320b164676', '["They were in many ways as liberal as those of today.","Matters relating to sex were seldom brought up in public.","There were great differences between the upper and the lower classes.","Gay relationships were outlawed but nonetheless frequent."]'::jsonb, NULL, '2016ht_provpass-2-verbal-hpguiden-se.pdf', '2016ht', 2, 33),
