is the precuneus. This brain area is involved in visual process- ing and memory, says Gil Yosipovich at the University of Miami. 35. “We can’t pinpoint what it does in itch, but it’s 35 activated A uniquely with itch as opposed to pain,” he says. B rarely For now, though, the single most effective way to get rid of C consequently an itch is what we do instinctively: to scratch. D hardly Stephani Sutherland, New Scientist Lothar and Theutberga It is a familiar story: a king dissatisfied with a loveless Waldrada – who some suspected had bewitched him, marriage that had lost its political value, burning to such was his emotional attachment to her. marry another woman accused by some of witchcraft', 'ce095ade6d8e', '[" But in handing the case over to the bishops, the young a group of educated royal advisers frantically devis- king had committed an error which ultimately brought ing strategies to make their king’s wishes a reality"," an down his kingdom. It was effectively an invitation for intransigent pope refusing to countenance any remar- others to get involved. The rulers of the kingdoms on riage on principle, with a dash of realpolitik thrown in. either side of Lothar’s realm were his two older uncles, The king is Lothar II, great-grandson of Charlemagne"," also descendants of the great Charlemagne – and with the the two women Theutberga and Waldrada"," the pope dream of reuniting Charlemagne’s fragmented empire Nicholas I. This was not just a royal divorce scandal – never very far from their thoughts. The king\"","The Pope from now on made all the decisions concerning royal weddings."]'::jsonb, 'C', '2023ht_provpass-5-verbal-hpguiden-se.pdf', '2023ht', 5, 40),
